## Third-party components

This repository contains no third-party code. It *drives* three external projects,
each under its own license, and `install.sh` clones one of them for you:

- **Cairn**: https://github.com/oritera/Cairn, **AGPL-3.0**.
  Free for personal and educational use. Commercial or proprietary use requires a
  commercial license from its author. `patches/0001-opencode-worker-backend.patch`
  is a modification to Cairn and is therefore distributed under the same terms as
  the file it patches. If you redistribute a patched Cairn, the AGPL applies to it.
- **Strix**: https://github.com/usestrix/strix, **Apache-2.0**. Installed
  separately; not bundled here.
- **Hermes Agent**: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent. Optional: the
  normal flow runs without it. When installed, it loads the `plugin/` directory,
  which is MIT as above.

Nothing in this repository is malware, and nothing here was written to target
systems without authorization. See the Authorization section of README.md.
